@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Admin" as U
participant "Admin Console" as C
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Supabase" as S
participant "Activity Log" as L

U -> C: Enter username + password
C -> A: POST /api/admin/login
A -> S: authenticateAdmin(username, password)
S --> A: admin user
A -> A: createSessionToken(secret, ttl)
A -> L: record admin.login
A --> C: 200 + Set-Cookie session
C --> U: Redirect to dashboard
note over A: Invalid credentials return 403 and set no cookie.
@enduml
